          "notes": "Scav is a third- and first-person extract-style shooter with zombies. The game includes violence in the form of combat against zombies using firearms. Players may encounter depictions of blood, gore, and injury consistent with a post-apocalyptic survival scenario.\r\n\r\nThe game also contains drug-related mechanics planned for future updates, such as farming and processing of illegal substances, along with associated story and gameplay elements. Alcohol use may be referenced in the context of survival gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe content is intended for a mature audience due to violence and drug-related themes."
        },
